{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09218","headline":"答史馆张学士段柳庶子学士集贤院看花见寄兼呈柳学士 · 韦应物","name":"答史馆张学士段柳庶子学士集贤院看花见寄兼呈柳学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"班杨秉文史，对院自爲邻。\n余香掩阁去，迟日看花频。\n似雪飘阊阖，从风点近臣。\n南宫有芳树，不竝禁垣春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}